  "details": "# Issue:\n\nIf you set the Gallery of your Group to be Public, people can also see it on the website without needing to join the Group first. This is not the case in the in game UI, there you always have to Join the Group to see it's Gallery no matter if it's set to be public or not.\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nAlso show the Gallery in game if it's set to be public.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nThe first picture shows the website and the second picture the in game UI:",
